-- collated ORDER BY: Parquet min/max statistics are bytewise, not collation-ordered, so the
-- row-group shortcut must stay off; 'ä' sorts before 'b' in the 'de' locale but its UTF-8
-- bytes are above 'z', so a stats-based skip of the second file would lose it
ä
